      "writtenOn": "2026-01-21T02:20:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: capturing the mParamsBuffer in ExternalTexture triggered validation failure. This seems to be a bug (477349135). However since webgpu::ExternalTexture should be a simple passthrough layer, it doesn\u0027t really need the mParamsBuffer. I was thinking about getting rid of this for webgpu backend a bit but that seems too intrusive to existing dawn frontend logic. (need to have a virtual Init or NeedParamsBuffer for the ExternalTextureBase, and BindGroupBase related code to resolve the binding also need to get updated). As a result for now just skip capturing the mParamsBuffer content by skipping triggering this capture bug.",
      "revId": "d36972c17b5d6714c08000064184aa7e32648728",
